      "seed": 796503669,
      "version": 777,
      "versionNonce": 1592946395,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785221856084,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Long term objective \n2. designing a system which can achieve the long term objective \n3. in this journey of achieving the long term objective - \n    - state transitions to be done. \n\nDecision process - select the right state to go to, such that i will meet the long term objective. \n\n1. Designing an agent \n2. agent knows the long term objective \n3. task agent - is to transition to the right next state from various other possibilities, such that the long term objective is met.\n4. the agent has nothing to do with past. it is all about present and future. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Long term objective \n2. designing a system which can achieve the long term objective \n3. in this journey of achieving the long term objective - \n    - state transitions to be done. \n\nDecision process - select the right state to go to, such that i will meet the long term objective. \n\n1. Designing an agent \n2. agent knows the long term objective \n3. task agent - is to transition to the right next state from various other possibilities, such that the long term objective is met.\n4. the agent has nothing to do with past. it is all about present and future. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
